{"id":"4757","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4757_main_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-and-cirrus-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处可以看到狭窄、较高的砧状鬃积雨云云塔。两个云塔的上部都有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">光滑</span>或<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">纤维状</span>部分，并且开始以相当随意的方式展开，如<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">6</span>所示。</p>\n<p>在背景中是一片密集、较厚而且范围广泛的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密卷云</span>，它是早期积雨云上部的残余部分。</p>\n<p>最明显的位置是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">一排浓积云</span>和中云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Wing Choi Ho","location":"中国香港赤鱲角","latitude":"纬度: 22° 18' 56'' N","longitude":"经度: 113° 55' 21'' E","date":"13 September 2010 1559 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 3","code":"图像P/S代码: S.10.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.10.5"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/4757_syn_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-and-cirrus-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>中国南方沿海上空的一道高压槽带来了潮湿的陆上风。阵雨在该地区和南中国海北部发展。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/4757_upper_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-and-cirrus-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"></div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/4757_sat_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-and-cirrus-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds.jpeg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>该EUMETSAT第1通道视觉图像显示了香港北部和东北部（位于中国南部沿海的内陆）的积雨云细胞。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4775_main_cumulonimbus-capillatus-praecipitatio-incus-mamma-praecipitatio_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>这张照片显示了发展完好的对称性云砧的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">鬃积雨云细胞</span>（砧状附加特征）。砧状云下表面显示正在形成<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">乳房状云</span>。左边和后面是另一个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">更近期的细胞</span>。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处，这两个细胞都在产生降水。</p>\n<p>在左边缘是另一个被确定为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>的积云状细胞。这个细胞即将过渡到秃积雨云。在许多区域可以看到更多处于不同发展阶段的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云</span>。</p>\n<p>积雨云被称为“云工厂”，可能产生<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密卷云</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">高积云</span>、高层云和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>的云块。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Mustafa Hayri Ayvaz","location":"土耳其伊斯坦布尔","latitude":"纬度: 40° 52' 50'' N","longitude":"经度: 29° 12' 39'' E","date":"04 May 2016 1659 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 6, CH= 3","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10.5"}]}]}